{"text": "From: Astrid Rasmussen-Kehoe <astrid.rk@northshoremail.example>\nTo: Release of Information <roi@gitchigamirmc.example>\nCc: lstenberg@stenberglaw.example\nDate: Sat, 8 Nov 2025 10:05:31 -0600\nSubject: Records request - patient Evangeline Rasmussen, MRN 4418-77-209\n\nTo the Release of Information office at Gitchi Gami Regional Medical Center:\n\nI am the daughter and health care agent of your patient Evangeline Rasmussen (maiden name Solheim-Berge). My mother is 94 years old and cannot make this request herself. The signed authorization and my health care directive are attached. I am asking under HIPAA, 45 CFR 164.524, and Minn. Stat. § 144.292.\n\nPatient: Evangeline M. Rasmussen\nDate of birth: May 2, 1931\nMRN: 4418-77-209\nMedicare no.: 2KM9-WD4-TX18\nHome before the nursing home: 4406 London Road, Duluth, MN 55804\n\nPlease send, in electronic form:\n1. The complete chart for the admission of September 22 to October 9, 2025, when she came to you by ambulance from Lakewood Shores Skilled Nursing with a stage 4 pressure wound on her tailbone and sepsis.\n2. The wound care photographs and the nursing skin assessments.\n3. Dr. Pinto's surgical notes from the debridement on September 24.\n4. The billing record. We received a statement for $48,216.40 and do not understand it.\n\nI'd also like the emergency department record from July 30, when she was seen after a fall at the nursing home and sent back the same night.\n\nPlease email the records to me and to our attorney, Lionel Stenberg (copied). If there is a charge above the $6.50 flat fee, call me first: 218-555-0138. Do not mail anything to Lakewood Shores; my mother is no longer there and we have filed a complaint against them with the state.\n\nShe is now with me at 212 Arrowhead Trail, Two Harbors, MN 55616, on hospice care, so time matters.\n\nThank you,\nAstrid", "kind": "Email", "detail": "294 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Astrid Rasmussen-Kehoe", "Evangeline Rasmussen", "Lionel Stenberg"], "companies": ["Northshoremail", "Gitchigami Regional Medical Center", "Stenberg Law", "Lakewood Shores Skilled Nursing"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Duluth", "Lakewood Shores Skilled Nursing", "Two Harbors", "Northshoremail.example", "Gitchi Gami Regional Medical Center"], "health": ["stage 4 pressure wound", "sepsis", "pressure wound", "skin assessments", "fall", "hospice care"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Astrid", "Evangeline", "Lionel"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.7999999970197678, "modelMs": 15292.20000000298, "topicMs": 22941.89999999851, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 28, "text": "Astrid Rasmussen-Kehoe", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Astrid Rasmussen-Kehoe"}, {"start": 30, "end": 62, "text": "astrid.rk@northshoremail.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "astrid.rk@northshoremail.example"}, {"start": 68, "end": 90, "text": "Release of Information", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Release of Information"}, {"start": 92, "end": 117, "text": "roi@gitchigamirmc.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "roi@gitchigamirmc.example"}, {"start": 123, "end": 152, "text": "lstenberg@stenberglaw.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "lstenberg@stenberglaw.example"}, {"start": 159, "end": 174, "text": "Sat, 8 Nov 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Sat, 8 Nov 2025"}, {"start": 225, "end": 245, "text": "Evangeline Rasmussen", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Evangeline M. Rasmussen"}, {"start": 251, "end": 262, "text": "4418-77-209", "kind": "record", "source": "patter